# LLM provider — change LLM_BASE_URL + LLM_MODEL to switch providers:
#   OpenAI:          https://api.openai.com/v1              gpt-4o
#   Kimi (Moonshot): https://api.moonshot.cn/v1             moonshot-v1-8k
#   Qwen (Alibaba):  https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1   qwen-plus
#   Gemini (compat): https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai  gemini-3.5-flash
#   DeepSeek:        https://api.deepseek.com/v1            deepseek-chat
#   Grok (xAI):      https://api.x.ai/v1                   grok-3-mini
